      "widgets_values": [
        "WORD-LEVEL MIXED-SCRIPT HTR WORKFLOW\n\nThis workflow segments lines into words,\nclassifies each word as printed (Fraktur)\nor handwritten (Kurrent), then routes to\nthe appropriate HTR model.\n\nKey settings:\n- Classifier threshold: 0.35 (SWT CV)\n  Fraktur CV ~0.15-0.30 → printed\n  Kurrent CV ~0.40-0.60 → handwritten\n- word_mode=True in KrakenMixedScriptRouter\n\nTo tune threshold: check debug_scores\noutput of PrintedHandwrittenClassifierV2\nfor actual CV values on your document.\n\nTo force all words to one script:\nSet override_mode = force_handwritten\nor force_printed in the classifier."
      ]
